#: main.cpp:27
msgid "KDE's application finder"
msgstr "KDE namakar programow"

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Install .desktop files into directory <dir>"
msgstr "Instaluju .desktop-dataje do zapiska <dir>"

#: main.cpp:36 toplevel.cpp:50
msgid "KAppfinder"
msgstr "KAppfinder"

#: toplevel.cpp:53
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Namakar program pyta za programami na Wašim systemje a doda je do "
"menijoweho systema KDE. Klikńće 'pytać' za startowanje, wubjerće "
"wotpowědne programy a klikńće potom na 'nałožić'."

#: toplevel.cpp:63
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Program"

#: toplevel.cpp:64
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Wopisanje"

#: toplevel.cpp:65
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Přikaz"

#: toplevel.cpp:76
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "Zjeće:"

#: toplevel.cpp:80
msgid "Scan"
msgstr "Pytać"

#: toplevel.cpp:85
msgid "Unselect All"
msgstr "Wubraće zběhnyć"

#: toplevel.cpp:245
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Summary: found %n application\n"
"Summary: found %n applications"
msgstr ""
"Dohromady sym %n programow namakał.\n"
"Dohromady sym %n program namakał.\n"
"Dohromady sym %n programaj namakał.\n"
"Dohromady sym %n programy namakał."

#: toplevel.cpp:288
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: %n application was added to the KDE menu system.\n"
"%n applications were added to the KDE menu system."
msgstr ""
"%n programow je so menijowemu systemej KDE dodało.\n"
"%n program je so menijowemu systemej KDE dodał.\n"
"%n programaj stej so menijowemu systemej KDE dodałoj.\n"
"%n programy su so menijowemu systemej KDE dodali."

